                                                                        <li
                                                                            class="w-full mb-6 [&amp;::before]:font-bold">
                                                                            <p
                                                                                class="body-md w-full min-h-6 scroll-mt-20 xl:scroll-mt-24">
                                                                                For the Phone Number Functionality,
                                                                                billable units of voice and SMS usage
                                                                                will be determined as follows, except
                                                                                where the Offering expressly provides
                                                                                otherwise:</p>
                                                                            <p
                                                                                class="body-md w-full min-h-6 scroll-mt-20 xl:scroll-mt-24">
                                                                                (i) <b>Voice calls.</b> The duration of
                                                                                each chargeable voice call is rounded up
                                                                                to the nearest whole minute. For
                                                                                illustration, a voice call of ten (10)
                                                                                seconds will be deducted from your
                                                                                included voice allowance as one (1)
                                                                                minute.<br><br></p>
                                                                            <p
                                                                                class="body-md w-full min-h-6 scroll-mt-20 xl:scroll-mt-24">
                                                                                (ii) <b>SMS messages.</b> SMS messages
                                                                                are counted in accordance with
                                                                                established mobile-industry standards,
                                                                                namely: (a) for messages encoded using
                                                                                the <b>GSM-7 (7-bit) character set</b>,
                                                                                each segment of up to <!-- --><b>160
                                                                                    characters</b> counts as one (1)
                                                                                SMS; and (b) for messages encoded using
                                                                                the <!-- --><b>Unicode / UCS-2 (16-bit)
                                                                                    character set</b> - which is used
                                                                                automatically where the message contains
                                                                                characters outside the GSM-7 set
                                                                                (including most non-Latin scripts,
                                                                                certain special characters and most
                                                                                emojis) - each segment of up to
                                                                                <!-- --><b>70 characters</b> counts as
                                                                                one (1) SMS. A message that exceeds the
                                                                                per-segment character limit of the
                                                                                applicable encoding will be transmitted
                                                                                as multiple SMS segments and will,
                                                                                <!-- --><b>even though it may appear on
                                                                                    your device screen as a single
                                                                                    message</b>, be deducted from your
                                                                                included SMS allowance (or charged at
                                                                                the applicable out-of-bundle rate) as
                                                                                two or more SMS accordingly. The
                                                                                encoding applied to each message is
                                                                                determined automatically by its
                                                                                content.<!-- --></p>
                                                                        </li>
